# Organizations architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/organizations.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/organizations.md).

**Permanent decision:** **Orgs** are **player-created** crews. Server owns
create / invite / kick / roles. MVP: **one Org per player**. Durable Postgres
state — not catalog. Orthogonal to NPC [Factions](../../docs/docs/architecture/factions.md)
(no shared rank / skill line). Party ≠ Org.
[HaloBand](../../docs/docs/architecture/haloband.md),
[Multiplayer](../../docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md).

When changing Org roster, invites, roles, Org chat, or Org bank, read the full
doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
